msgid ""
"The SBUS pin, can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, "
"except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, "
"FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without "
"telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外，它们需要真正的 UART "
"连接。不过，FPort 以这种方式连接时只能提供 RC，而没有数传。"

